mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(217,217,217);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">2.</span></b><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">教学目标</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">/Course Objectives</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Courier New';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">（结合本校办学定位、学生情况、专业人才培养要求，应体现价值引领、知识传授、能力培养等方面的内容。）</font></span><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:63.5500pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(255,255,255);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>通过临床实践，使学生掌握口腔颌面部常见病、多发病（如阻生牙、颌面部感染、创伤等）的基本理论、诊断与治疗原则；能够在指导下完成门诊常见手术操作（如简单拔牙、牙槽外科手术），并初步了解住院病房诊疗流程。同时，培养其规范的临床操作技能、无菌观念、医患沟通能力及医疗文书书写能力。最终，引导学生建立对外科思维的初步认识、严谨的职业态度和对患者的同理心，为其未来职业生涯或深造奠定坚实的临床基础。</p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:19.9000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(217,217,217);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">3</font></span></b><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span
                                    style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">.</span></b><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">教学方式</font><font
                                        face="Times New Roman">/Teaching Methods</font></span></b><sub><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;
vertical-align:sub;"><font face="仿宋">（应体现实现教学目标所采用的具体策略、方法和组织形式）</font></span></sub><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:66.6500pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(255,255,255);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>1. 全程跟诊：由主治及以上医师带教，学生全程参与门诊接诊、治疗及术后随访，在实时指导下进行病史采集、检查与基本操作。<br>2. 分层级操作训练：遵循“观摩-助诊-主操作”的渐进路径。先在模型上练习，再作为助手参与，最后在导师监督下完成指定操作（如简单拔牙），确保安全与质量。<br>3. 病例为中心的学习：每日晨会交班、每周安排典型病例或疑难病例讨论。学生需准备发言，培养其诊断思维、治疗计划制定及循证决策能力。<br>4. 结构化教学与复盘：定期开展小讲课（聚焦核心疾病与操作规范）、术前讨论与术后复盘。结合手术录像或示意图，重点剖析操作要点、并发症预防及应急处理。<br>5. 多维评估与反馈：通过迷你临床评估（Mini-CEX）、操作技能直接观察（DOPS）及日常日志，对学生的临床思维、技能与职业态度进行形成性评价，并提供即时反馈。</p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:22.4500pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(217,217,217);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">4.教学内容及进度安排</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">/Course Content & Schedule</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">（</font></span><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Courier New';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">按照教学周编排，应包含每节课教学内容及教学目标，如有作业及考核要求，请一并列明）</font></span><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:176.7000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>31名学生分为6批</p>
<p>每批学生数：5名（其中一批6名）</p>
<p>每批实习周数：10周（门诊5周+病房5周）</p>
<p>每周实习天数：病房5天（周一至周五），门诊4天（周一至周四）</p>
<p>每名学生总实习时间：45天（门诊20天，病房25天）</p>
<p>病房实习：4周中山/华山，1周合川路病房</p>
<p>带教：门诊：邓荣欣/王猛（A/B角）；病房：刘喆麒，裴源，刘嘉靓</p>
<p>地点：门诊：市口腔医院口腔颌面外科门诊<br>病房：中山医院口腔颌面外科病房，华山医院口腔颌面外科病房，市口腔医院口腔颌面外科病房</p>
<p>门诊：</p>
<table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc; border: 1px solid #000000;" border="1">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="161">
<p>周数</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="345">
<p>实习内容</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>实习要求</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="328">
<p>教学活动（每周2次）</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="161">
<p>第1周</p>
<p>基础阶段</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="345">
<p>1.入科教育：科室介绍、实习安排、实习工作量要求、劳动纪律、服务态度、出科考试等。</p>
<p>2.器械识别：拔牙器械、其他门诊外科器械等。</p>
<p>3.操作见习：门诊常规诊疗和具体操作（门诊病历书写、 常见疾病诊疗规范、牙拔除术和其他牙槽外科手术规范）。</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>1.明确实习阶段各项相关要求。</p>
<p>2.清楚识别口腔常用器械。</p>
<p>3.明确门诊病历书写规范、常见疾病的诊疗规范。</p>
<p>4.牢记牙拔除术和其他牙槽外科手术规范。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="328">
<p>1.口腔颌面部检查</p>
<p>2.口腔颌面部浸润及阻滞麻醉</p>
<p>3.拔牙术操作</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="161">
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="345">
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="328">
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="161">
<p>第2、3周</p>
<p>提高阶段</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="345">
<p>在教师指导或监督下：</p>
<p>1.出诊接诊。</p>
<p>2.开展各种牙拔除术（松动牙、残根残冠、折裂牙、简单阻生牙）。</p>
<p>3.其他门诊疾病检查、诊疗方案的制订和处理（脓肿切开引流,、活组织检查、止血、颌面部包扎等）。</p>
<p>4.每日进行实习小结。</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>1.完成门诊简单疾病的接诊。</p>
<p>2.在教师指导下完成复杂疾病接诊。</p>
<p>3.独立完成常规牙拔除术（松动牙、残根残冠、折裂牙、简单阻生牙）。</p>
<p>4.独立或在教师指导下完成其他门诊疾病的检查及诊疗方案的制定。</p>
<p>5.对每日接诊病例进行专业总结。</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="328">
<p>1.唾液腺结石类疾病治疗</p>
<p>2.口内及口外脓肿切排</p>
<p>3.各类系带修整术</p>
<p>4.各类牙槽骨修整术</p>
<p>5.活组织检查</p>
<p>6.拔牙经验讨论（学生）</p>
<p>7.三叉神经痛诊断方法</p>
<p>8.颞下颌关节紊乱病治疗</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="161">
<p>第4、5周</p>
<p>精进阶段</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="345">
<p>1.逐步掌握门诊各项诊疗常规和技术操作。</p>
<p>2.开展复杂拔牙术（埋伏阻生牙及多生牙）。</p>
<p>3.参与复杂疑难病历的检查与诊治方案的制定及多学科会诊。</p>
<p>4.学习门诊中新技术、 新疗法的临床应用。</p>
<p>5.每日记录实习小结。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="312">
<p>1.逐步掌握门诊常见疾病的诊疗常规和技术操作。</p>
<p>2.独立完成复杂拔牙术（埋伏阻生牙及多生牙）。</p>
<p>3.初步建立多学科诊疗思维概念。</p>
<p>4.在教师指导下初步实践疾病诊疗创新思维。</p>
<p>5.对每日接诊病例进行专业总结，并对类似疾病诊疗过程进行归纳。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="328">
<p>1.埋伏阻生牙和多生牙拔除</p>
<p>2.颌间结扎及复位固定术</p>
<p>3.多学科联合诊疗病例汇报（学生）</p>
<p>4.前沿文献汇报（学生）</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
