<p>基础阶段</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" rowspan="2" width="321">
<p>1.入科教育：科室介绍、实习安排、实习工作量要求、劳动纪律、服务态度、出科考试等。 2.在老师指导下，开展患者问诊、专科检查、全身检查结果判读、完成病历书写。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" rowspan="2" width="338">
<p>1.明确实习阶段各项相关要求。</p>
<p>2.熟悉专科检查方法及全身检查结果的临床意义。</p>
<p>3.明确病房病历书写规范。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" rowspan="2" width="309">
<p>1.住院病历的书写</p>
<p>2.口内良性小肿物切除</p>
<p>3.腮腺良恶性肿瘤鉴别</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="177">
<p>第2-5周</p>
<p>提高阶段</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="321">
<p>在教师的指导下：</p>
<p>1.术前洗手、消毒铺巾，穿手术衣及戴手套等。</p>
<p>2.逐步参与手术（二助）。</p>
<p>3.患者管理，包括收入患者、病历书写、查房、换药、办理出院、值班等。</p>
<p>4.每日进行实习小结。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="338">
<p>1.学会术前自我消毒及防护。</p>
<p>2.学会针对患者的消毒和铺巾。</p>
<p>3.学会第二助手常用技术（吸引器、拉钩等）。</p>
<p>4.明确病房工作流程，参与患者全程管理。</p>
<p>5.完成每周一次教学查房。</p>
<p>6.每日归纳工作内容。</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="309">
<p>1.口腔恶性肿瘤的治疗原则</p>
<p>2.口腔颌面部肿瘤的诊疗思路</p>
<p>3.不同颌骨病变的诊疗思路</p>
<p>4.正颌手术常用术式及适应症</p>
<p>5.手术二助经验讨论（学生）</p>
<p>6.前沿文献汇报（学生）</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
